{"Code":200,"Message":"operation success","MoreMessage":"","TipType":"Success","Count":34,"ReturnUrl":null,"Data":[{"Id":"2a63b891-4c9b-494a-96bb-f4aed689888d","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":511195470,"PostDateInt":1786332817000,"PostDate":"2026-08-10T11:33:37","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"智慧营销项目经理(J11123)","OrgId":3655372,"Org":"智慧座舱解决方案中心","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["江苏省·南京市·鼓楼区"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"1. 售前项目支撑，配合销售落地转化\n深度配合销售团队对接连锁药店、高端零售总部及门店客户，负责线下客户拜访、需求调研、场景梳理；协助销售推进签约，提升整体成单率。\n2. 项目整体统筹与进度管控\n作为项目第一负责人，统筹智慧营销系统项目的全生命周期管理，包含立项、规划、落地、实施、上线、验收全流程。根据客户连锁规模、门店场景制定项目实施计划，把控项目节奏、关键节点与落地质量，跟进项目推进情况，及时识别项目风险、协调解决落地问题，确保项目按时、高质量交付。\n3. 客户对接、落地推进与资源协调\n负责客户高层、门店管理端的日常对接与沟通，同步项目进度、落地规划及优化方案；对内协调技术、产品、售后等资源，统筹门店部署、系统调试、功能落地、人员培训等工作，保障项目高效推进，提升客户体验与满意度。\n4. 项目落地赋能与标准化沉淀\n针对连锁药店、高端零售行业场景，沉淀标准化POC演示流程、项目实施流程、门店落地规范、客户培训体系；总结标杆客户案例，形成可快速复制的落地标准，适配公司大批量客户快速导入的业务节奏。\n5. 项目复盘与交付质量把控\n负责项目资料整理、归档、复盘，持续优化实施流程、解决交付共性问题，保障交付稳定性，助力老客户留存、增购及转介绍。","Require":"1. 基础要求\n211或者985本科及以上，1-3年以上ToB SaaS、智能系统、数字化项目实施或项目管理经验；有连锁零售、药店、高端零售行业项目经验者优先。\n2. 核心能力要求\n具备独立的售前支撑、客户沟通、POC演示、项目统筹能力，能够独立跟进完整项目落地；熟悉门店数字化、智慧营销类产品落地逻辑，可快速理解AI工牌、语音质检、会话分析、门店营销赋能等产品场景。\n优秀的项目管控能力、逻辑清晰，能够同时统筹多个并行项目，把控进度、风险与交付质量；具备较强的跨部门资源协调能力与客户问题解决能力。\n3. 综合素质\n目标感强、抗压性强，适配业务快速扩张节奏；沟通表达得体，能够对接客户管理层、门店负责人等关键人员；可接受短期线下出差、上门对接客户。\n4. 优先加分项\n有连锁药店、美妆、珠宝、高端零售门店数字化项目实施/项目管理经验；有SaaS产品售前演示、POC落地、连锁批量上线项目经验优先。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":true,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":"本科","YearsOfWorking":"3年","WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":true,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-08-10T11:33:37","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"0e190805-ba1a-4156-9b07-0e53c30c7153","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":511136850,"PostDateInt":1773912950000,"PostDate":"2026-03-19T17:35:50","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"大模型研究员（博士后）(J10968)","OrgId":958826,"Org":"大模型事业部","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["北京市"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"一）AI + 医疗方向\n1.\t医疗大模型高效训练技术：探索多模态医疗数据（文本、影像、临床记录等）的预训练、微调及领域适配方法，就像是给医疗大模型 “定制成长计划”，让它变得聪明又能干；\n2.\t医疗知识推理与可解释性：研究大模型在诊断辅助、治疗方案生成中的逻辑推理能力如何增强，以及如何让它的决策过程能被大家看懂，给医疗决策加上 “安心保障”；\n3.\t医疗场景应用关键技术：开发面向临床决策支持、医学问答、电子病历分析的轻量化部署和隐私保护方案，让医疗数据安全又高效地发挥作用；\n4.\t医疗伦理与合规性：研究大模型在医疗场景中的伦理约束、数据安全和合规性框架，给医疗 AI 的发展画好 “规范跑道”。\n（二）AI + 教育方向\n1.\t教育大模型个性化学习：基于 AI 技术分析学生的学习行为和特点，为每个学生打造专属的 “学习秘籍”，真正实现因材施教；\n2.\t智能教学交互技术：探索多模态交互在教育场景里的应用，让课堂互动变得超有趣，实现智能辅导、情感识别与反馈，让学习体验直线上升；\n3.\t教育质量评估与优化：利用 AI 和大数据建立教育质量评估模型，就像给教学做 “全面体检”，为教学改进和教育决策提供科学依据；\n4.\t教育资源智能管理：开发教育资源的智能分类、检索和推荐技术，让找教育资源像有个 “智能小助手” 一样方便，提高资源利用效率。\n（三）AI + 自然资源/测绘地理信息方向\n1.\t地理空间、自然资源知识图谱和高质量数据构建；\n2.\t自然资源大数据体系构建和开发利用；\n3.\t自然资源业务大模型训练、微调、工程实现和成效评估；\n4.\t多模态遥感数据智能解译；\n5.\t自然资源智能场景开发。","Require":"1.\t计算机科学、人工智能、生物医学工程、数学、教育学，或者相关专业的小伙伴看过来；\n2.\t如果你熟悉自然语言处理（NLP）、深度学习框架（比如 PyTorch/TensorFlow） ，有大模型训练或医疗 AI、教育 AI 项目经验，那可就太合适啦！要是还懂医疗知识图谱、多模态学习，那就更棒啦！如果对地理信息系统（GIS）、遥感图像处理有研究，在自然资源大数据分析方面有经验，在这个新方向上也能大展拳脚；\n3.\t得具备独立开展相关研究、发表高水平学术论文、参与国家级 / 企业合作科研项目，还能推动技术落地应用的能力，咱们一起把科研想法变成现实！","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":true,"Channel4IsLong":true,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":"博士研究生","YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":true,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-03-19T17:35:50","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"f9789e8f-2fff-4126-a556-6154aa3006b5","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":511118484,"PostDateInt":1768465209000,"PostDate":"2026-01-15T16:20:09","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"医疗销售经理(J11036)","OrgId":3993213,"Org":"紫金山团队_南京","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["江苏省·南京市"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"工作职责：\n1、负责指定区域的市场开发、新老客户维护和销售、管理等工作；根据公司销售目标、制定销售计划，完成个人销售指标、利润指标和应收账款指标等基础职能要求，负责实施团队与院方/甲方客户的协调与沟通  \n2、负责所属区域的产品宣传、推广，完成销售的任务指标；经营区域与目标客户建立良好的长期业务关系，高效灵活的完成销售任务。  \n3、制定自己的销售计划，并按计划拜访客户和开发新客户； 收集市场信息，进行市场判断，并对竞争对手分析，及时反馈给上级主管并提供建设性意见。 \n4、搜集市场信息，积极开发新客户，对新客户各类信息进行调查、核实，并建立客户档案 \n5、做好销售合同的投标、签订、履行与管理等相关工作，以及协调处理各类市场问题； \n6、负责开拓新市场，发展新客户，挖掘新的项目机会并跟进成单，了解、跟踪客户需求动态，反馈客户开发的进展情况；  \n7、接待来访客户，协调内外部关系提高客户满意度，完成领导交办的其他临时性工作，以及综合协调日常销售事务。","Require":"任职要求：\n1、本科及以上学历；\n2、五年以上销售工作经验、三年以上医疗器械或医疗软件行业销售经验； \n3、有独立完成文档的编写能力，项目招投标经验，具备基本档案行业知识； \n4、具备优秀的客户需求分析及项目把握、商务谈判能力；\n5、抗压力能力强，思想清晰、敏捷，具备良好的沟通技巧与表达能力； \n6、勤勉且勇于接受挑战，能够适应江苏省内出差，具备较强的前瞻能力和风险管控能力。 \n7、有医保或医疗卫生行业项目经验或丰富的政府、区县资源，对系统集成熟悉者优先。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":true,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":"本科","YearsOfWorking":"5年","WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":true,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-01-15T16:20:09","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"159fa61d-9941-4451-a8ab-116504f9e799","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":511118481,"PostDateInt":1768465105000,"PostDate":"2026-